OL,3,GNEWSA'My son was violent, aggressive, a
OL,4,Adanger to himself'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucas was a happy and sociable child
OL,7,Fwho was thriving in school when he
OL,8,Fdeveloped scarlet fever in 2025. Just a
OL,9,Ffew weeks later he was anxious and
OL,10,Fviolent and he was having suicidal
OL,11,Fthoughts.
OL,13,FNow aged 10, Lucas has been housebound
OL,14,Ffor the past six months because he is
OL,15,Ftoo scared to leave the safety of his
OL,16,FBristol home.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
