OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1794295559
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'My son was violent, aggressive, a
OL,4,Adanger to himself'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family did not know it in 2025 but
OL,7,FLucas had developed Paediatric
OL,8,FAcute-onset Neuropsychiatric Disorders
OL,9,FAssociated with Streptococcal
OL,10,Finfections (PANDAS), a little-known
OL,11,Fcondition which can cause severe
OL,12,Fpsychological symptoms in children.
OL,14,FResearchers believe PANDAS is the
OL,15,Fresult of a faulty immune response to a
OL,16,Fstreptococcal infection and it can lead
OL,17,Fto anxiety and OCD as well as physical
OL,18,Fand vocal tics and aggression.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
